"ティマイオス","textMapHash":3382997382,"text":"このまま規則を守って研究してたら、きっと僕の錬金術の腕は進歩しないままだと思う。","nextNodeIds":[409110106]},{"nodeId":409110107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1607832798,"text":"生物錬金の研究？","nextNodeIds":[409110108]},{"nodeId":409110109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":525013414,"text":"古代の錬金術の研究？","nextNodeIds":[409110110]},{"nodeId":409110106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1587,"speakerName":"ティマイオス","textMapHash":3740582262,"text":"だから、普通とは違った観点で、新しい研究を始めたいんだけど…","nextNodeIds":[409110107,409110109]},{"nodeId":409110108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1587,"speakerName":"ティマイオス","textMapHash":564171838,"text":"ああ、それはもう他に研究してる人がいるから、普通と違うとは言えないかな…","nextNodeIds":[409110111]},{"nodeId":409110110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1587,"speakerName":"ティマイオス","textMapHash":709959542,"text":"古代錬金術？えっと、それは僕じゃまだ手に負えない分野かな…","nextNodeIds":[409110111]},{"nodeId":409110111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1587,"speakerName":"ティマイオス","textMapHash":215483462,"text":"うん…錬金術に一番大事なものは何か知ってる？そう、「元素」さ。","nextNodeIds":[409110112]},{"nodeId":409110112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1587,"speakerName":"ティマイオス","textMapHash":3057510518,"text":"通常の錬金術では、様々な要因により何らかの元素付着のある材料が使用され、純粋な元素力とは異なってしまう。","nextNodeIds":[409110113]},{"nodeId":409110113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1587,"speakerName":"ティマイオス","textMapHash":88090966,"text":"そういう材料を使うと、錬金の過程で不純物が生まれる。そういう不純物は元素反応の効率に影響するんだ…","nextNodeIds":[409110114]},{"nodeId":409110114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1587,"speakerName":"ティマイオス","textMapHash":625525270,"text":"必要な元素材料が多くなるだけでなく、不純物が錬金過程で直接影響しないように、観察も必要でね…","nextNodeIds":[409110115]},{"nodeId":409110115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1587,"speakerName":"ティマイオス","textMapHash":4213042542,"text":"「神の目」を持っていない人にとって、錬金術を行いたいなら、そういったことも受け入れないといけないんだけど。","nextNodeIds":[409110116]},{"nodeId":409110116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1587,"speakerName":"ティマイオス","textMapHash":336635950,"text":"一番の問題は、そういう元素材料の費用が、とてもとても高いことなんだ。","nextNodeIds":[409110117]},{"nodeId":409110117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1587,"speakerName":"ティマイオス","textMapHash":3247496798,"text":"一回の錬金術で、その錬金成果よりも材料費のが気になってしまうほどだよ…","nextNodeIds":[409110118]},{"nodeId":409110119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3673617238,"text":"「神の目」は持ってないよ。","nextNodeIds":[409110120]},{"nodeId":409110121,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":4227619998,"text":"じゃあ、何か用でも？","nextNodeIds":[409110122]},{"nodeId":409110118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1587,"speakerName":"ティマイオス","textMapHash":1357723630,"text":"はぁ、だから僕の錬金術は限界を突破しないのかもしれないね…","nextNodeIds":[409110119,409110123]},{"nodeId":409110120,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1587,"speakerName":"ティマイオス","textMapHash":1637763614,"text":"うん…それは聞いた。でも君は元素の力を操ることができる、そうだね？","nextNodeIds":[409110123]},{"nodeId":409110122,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1587,"speakerName":"ティマイオス","textMapHash":1863329390,"text":"君は「神の目」を持ってないのに、元素の力を操れるって聞いたけど、本当かい？","nextNodeIds":[409110123]},{"nodeId":409110123,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1587,"speakerName":"ティマイオス","textMapHash":4094083782,"text":"実は、新しい錬金炉を研究してるんだ。<color=#00E1FFFF>「元素クルーシブル」</color>と言って、その原理は…","nextNodeIds":[409110124]},{"nodeId":409110124,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1587,"speakerName":"ティマイオス","textMapHash":872226614,"text":"えっと、簡単に言うと、純粋な元素を収納し、互いに反応させられる器なんだ。","nextNodeIds":[409110125]},{"nodeId":409110125,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1587,"speakerName":"ティマイオス","textMapHash":3971907262,"text":"この「元素クルーシブル」で錬金すれば、僕の錬金術の腕も上がるかもしれない…","nextNodeIds":[409110126]},{"nodeId":409110126,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1587,"speakerName":"ティマイオス","textMapHash":1910918022,"text":"準備は全て済んだけど、あとは純粋な元素を「運ぶ」ために、元素を自由に操れる人がいる。","nextNodeIds":[409110127]},{"nodeId":409110127,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1587,"speakerName":"ティマイオス","textMapHash":2517875710,"text":"君さえよければ、<color=#00E1FFFF>千風の神殿</color>に来てほしいんだ。設備の組み立ては他の人に頼んだから。","nextNodeIds":[409110128]},{"nodeId":409110128,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1587,"speakerName":"ティマイオス","textMapHash":1874617214,"text":"今回、僕の錬金術に新たな突破の道が開かれるといいんだけど…","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[4091101,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[{"LNHLPKELCAL":["5001","500103"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_ACTIVE_ACTIVITY_COND_STATE"}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["1587"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}},{"subQuestId":4091102,"order":2,"stepDescription":"千風の神殿に行く","stepDescTextMapHash":536428710,"finishConds":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[4091102,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_FINISH_PLOT","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_POINT","LNHLPKELCAL":["Q4091103Timaeus","60"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_LOCATION"},"isHidden":false,"talkIds":[],"talks":[],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[4091102,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_FINISH_PLOT","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFM